# Build context of infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile (CM-T065). Secrets and local state never enter
# an image: environment files, keys and certificates are excluded here, and the runtime images
# copy only build output from the build stage. Dependencies are installed inside the build.
.git
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# Environment files and key material (CLAUDE.md section 8)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.p8
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
cloud-secrets
infrastructure/deployment/local

# Build and test output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/dist
**/out
**/out-meta
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/api/src/generated
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
blob-report
sbom.cdx.json
